<div class="p-3">
  <h4 class="mb-3">Changelog</h4>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <b>2026-09-03</b>
      <ul>
        <li>Added cut marks in the page margins showing where to cut to separate the cards.</li>
        <li>Updated the card back art to full-bleed versions that print edge-to-edge.</li>
        <li>Smaller PDF file sizes and lower memory use from more efficient card image encoding.</li>
        <li>Added local PDF storage so the app can run without AWS in development.</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>
      <b>2026-09-01</b>
      <ul>
        <li>Added support for bonded cards (e.g. Soothing Melody).</li>
        <li>Investigator card back now always prints, next to its front.</li>
        <li>Added a printshop card-spacing option with a black bleed.</li>
        <li>Print options (backs, spacing, duplex) added to all tabs.</li>
        <li>Reduced memory use so larger decks and campaigns work reliably.</li>
        <li>Faster repeat prints via card image and metadata caching.</li>
        <li>Clearer progress bar and a nicer message when the server is busy.</li>
        <li>Removed the whole-campaign print option (too heavy for the server).</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li><b>2026-08-28</b>: All current campaigns added (thanks to <a href="https://github.com/FiveFingerDiscount">FiveFingerDiscount</a>).</li>
  </ul>

  <hr>
  <p class="text-muted">Found a bug or have a suggestion? Please open an issue on the
    <a href="https://github.com/fahseltc/arkhamprint.xyz">GitHub page</a>.</p>
</div>
